      <tr class="border-t border-slate-200"><td class="p-3 font-bold text-sm">Регулировка напряжения</td><td class="p-3 text-center">PPS (3,3-21V, шаг 20mV)</td><td class="p-3 text-center text-brandBlue font-bold">PPS + AVS (15-48V)</td><td class="p-3 text-center">AVS уточнён</td></tr>
